    {
      "id": "about",
      "type": "section",
      "props": {
        "width": "boxed",
        "paddingY": 8
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "about-row",
          "type": "row",
          "props": {
            "gap": 0,
            "stackOn": "never"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "about-col",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 12
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "about-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks University",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When it comes to keeping your business’s trucks on the roads around South Florida and beyond, Rechtien University is there to make sure your team is properly trained. Designed to help your technicians and fleet managers get the most out of every International® truck you run, our program covers the skills that keep vehicles safe, compliant and on the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "about-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Along with making sure your team is informed and ready to work with your vehicles in multiple capacities, we also take your budget into account. Our program is not only high-quality and competitively priced, but it can also help you with minimizing operating costs. Find out more about our reputable semi truck service technician classes and fleet manager courses below!",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "adv-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien University program advantages",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "adv-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Whether you’re more focused on fleet manager courses or <a href=\"/service\">semi truck service technician</a> classes, you’ll find it all at Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks. In addition to our thorough curriculum, you’ll find plenty of other reasons to choose our advanced program. Just a few of our course advantages include:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "adv-list",
                  "type": "list",
                  "props": {
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "columns": 1,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "label": "International Motors approved training courses"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Certifications printed upon completion of course"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Available Online"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Track student progress with Managerial Reports"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Customer-designated administrators can access education records for all their students"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "Unlimited enrollment"
                      },
                      {
                        "label": "One time fee per employee"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uni",
      "type": "section",
      "props": {
        "width": "boxed",
        "paddingY": 8,
        "background": "paper"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "uni-head",
          "type": "row",
          "props": {
            "gap": 0
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "uni-head-col",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 12
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "uni-h",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks - South Carolina University",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "uni-row",
          "type": "row",
          "props": {
            "gap": 7,
            "stackOn": "tablet",
            "align": "start"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "uni-logo-col",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 5
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "uni-logo",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "image": {
                      "src": "https://vendure.ai4dealerships.com/assets/source/d1/logocit.png",
                      "alt": "Rechtien University online training logo",
                      "width": 600,
                      "height": 600
                    },
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-cap",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Get the most from your fleet using the Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks - South Carolina customized online training portal.",
                    "align": "center",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-brand",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks - South Carolina",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "id": "uni-copy",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 7
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "uni-t1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "International Trucks advanced vehicle technologies provide more UPTIME, calling for comprehensive training in service systems, maintenance and repair procedures. Count on Rechtien University to provide comprehensive online training designed to give you the tools you need to control your UPTIME and reduce maintenance costs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-t2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Our online portal offers training on your time, convenient access, effective training, completion certificates, and verified learning.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-t3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Contact us today to learn how the Rechtien University online training can help you increase up-time and reduce maintenance costs: Sam Scarborough, Rechtien International Trucks and Carolina International Trucks - South Carolina Training Manager <a href=\"mailto:SSscarborough@CarolinaInternational.com\">SSscarborough@CarolinaInternational.com</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-join-t",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you are ready to join, complete and submit the Student Education Request form.",
                    "align": "center",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-join",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "student-education-request"
                      }
                    ],
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-enrolled",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Already enrolled? LOGIN to start or continue your comprehensive online Rechtien University training.",
                    "align": "center",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "uni-login",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "cit-university-login"
                      }
                    ],
                    "align": "center"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
